# Nightly: label each recorded sd-review tier as right or one too shallow,
# from what happened after its merge (sd:2107). Asks no model: it reads the
# ledger through sd-db.sh, the pull request through gh, and the default branch
# through git in the registered checkout.
#
# After repo-sync-nightly (02:45), so each checkout's origin/<base> is fresh;
# a stale one is skipped as `checkout behind`, never labelled. A row whose
# outcome gh cannot read tonight is skipped and read again tomorrow.
JOB_SCHEDULE="30 3 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="\"$ROOT/../local-jev/jev.sh\" label sd-review --apply"
